BlockBeats News, November 10th, according to Farside Investors monitoring, the U.S. Bitcoin Spot ETF has seen a total net inflow of $25.857 billion since its launch, hitting a new all-time high. Breakdown:


· BlackRock's IBIT saw a total net inflow of $27.387 billion;
· Fidelity's FBTC saw a total net inflow of $10.761 billion;
· Grayscale's GBTC saw a total net outflow of $20.141 billion.

